              "block_type": "dialogue",
              "speaker": "贵妃",
              "text": "你该知道，回到这里的人，先要学会低头。",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "line_id": "ln_001_002_003",
              "block_type": "dialogue",
              "speaker": "女主",
              "text": "臣妾低过头，所以才看清谁踩着旧案往上爬。",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "underline",
                  "offset_range": [9, 13]
